WEBVTT

01:31.050 --> 01:34.990
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.030 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 2]

01:39.840 --> 01:41.479
Gods, deities,

01:41.509 --> 01:43.229
I prey for good luck.

01:43.229 --> 01:44.920
Let me win this game.

01:45.000 --> 01:47.220
Bring me a fortune.

01:47.400 --> 01:48.330
You'll all lose!

01:54.310 --> 01:54.920
Seven.

01:55.000 --> 01:55.310
Seven?

01:55.310 --> 01:58.509
The Player takes the first tile,
and the Banker the third.

02:03.200 --> 02:03.920
Can't see it.

02:03.920 --> 02:04.850
Do you see it now?

02:07.680 --> 02:08.280
Were you just

02:08.280 --> 02:09.560
tricked by that man?

02:11.080 --> 02:11.680
Yes.

02:12.940 --> 02:15.200
He's a notorious bully in the local area.

02:19.910 --> 02:20.560
You lost.

02:23.030 --> 02:24.160
I got two same tiles.

02:24.710 --> 02:25.840
What does it matter?

02:26.240 --> 02:27.310
Look carefully.

02:28.840 --> 02:31.020
This is 10,

02:31.590 --> 02:33.340
and this is 11.

02:33.470 --> 02:34.960
You're the one who lost.

02:37.750 --> 02:38.840
That's not fair!

02:38.840 --> 02:41.170
-That's not the rule!
-Just admit defeat!

02:41.430 --> 02:42.160
The money...

02:44.030 --> 02:45.079
The higher score wins,

02:45.079 --> 02:46.410
and the lower one loses.

02:46.430 --> 02:48.230
No other restrictions, right?

02:48.710 --> 02:50.850
Who dares to refute it?

02:51.910 --> 02:52.470
Mister,

02:53.240 --> 02:53.840
is this

02:53.870 --> 02:55.600
how you play it beyond the pass?

02:55.710 --> 02:57.620
I've never heard of such rules.

02:57.680 --> 02:58.400
Rules?

02:59.079 --> 03:00.190
There is only one rule beyond the pass.

03:00.190 --> 03:02.240
That is, the locals always win!

03:02.520 --> 03:04.520
You'd better get your hands off.

03:04.680 --> 03:05.340
Otherwise,

03:06.000 --> 03:07.120
I'll break your fingers!

03:07.120 --> 03:07.560
Look.

03:21.079 --> 03:22.480
It's a real gun, isn't it?

03:25.280 --> 03:27.480
According to the rules beyond the pass,

03:27.840 --> 03:29.170
would you say my bullets

03:29.280 --> 03:30.610
can crush your cranium?

03:31.310 --> 03:31.910
What now?

03:33.000 --> 03:34.079
I'm fearless.

03:36.400 --> 03:38.560
Shoot me, I dare you.

03:39.030 --> 03:40.030
Pull the trigger!

03:53.079 --> 03:54.079
That's a real gun!

04:00.030 --> 04:01.360
Guess if I dare to shoot.

04:01.710 --> 04:02.370
Fancy a bet?

04:03.750 --> 04:05.670
I-I bet you wouldn't dare!

04:05.750 --> 04:06.810
You wouldn't dare!

04:09.360 --> 04:09.960
Guys,

04:10.870 --> 04:13.000
are you
on the Banker's side or the Player's?

04:13.000 --> 04:14.030
Place your bets

04:14.080 --> 04:15.240
before I pull the trigger.

04:15.240 --> 04:17.600
The Player!

04:17.920 --> 04:19.160
All in!

04:19.310 --> 04:22.390
Shoot! Shoot him!

04:22.480 --> 04:23.430
Do it now!

04:24.980 --> 04:25.680
One.

04:32.000 --> 04:32.720
Two.

04:37.560 --> 04:38.220
Don't move!

04:45.510 --> 04:46.730
Mr. Li,

04:47.360 --> 04:48.820
I've been waiting for you.

04:49.270 --> 04:50.730
They told me you were here.

04:52.870 --> 04:53.830
Yes. I'm here.

04:56.750 --> 04:57.270
Move!

05:01.310 --> 05:02.360
Get a move on!

05:08.270 --> 05:09.070
Commander Xu,

05:09.360 --> 05:10.890
we couldn't find anything.

05:14.510 --> 05:15.800
You mean to keep

05:16.270 --> 05:17.800
that large sum of money to yourselves,

05:17.800 --> 05:18.430
right?

05:19.310 --> 05:20.630
Everything beyond the pass

05:20.630 --> 05:21.960
belongs to the Emperor.

05:22.950 --> 05:24.000
You want to steal?

05:24.750 --> 05:25.750
That severe crime

05:25.750 --> 05:26.720
gives enough grounds

05:26.720 --> 05:28.120
to execute both of you.

05:28.790 --> 05:29.850
Where is the money?

05:30.270 --> 05:30.830
Mom!

05:35.500 --> 05:36.360
I don't know.

05:36.920 --> 05:38.050
I've never seen any!

05:38.920 --> 05:40.250
Commander Xu, Commander Xu!

05:40.250 --> 05:41.850
Her husband was just buried.

05:41.950 --> 05:42.480
Please show some mercy...

05:42.480 --> 05:43.740
You're against me too?

05:44.310 --> 05:45.790
Do you want to die or what?

05:46.560 --> 05:47.950
Listen up!

05:48.560 --> 05:49.630
This whole settlement will suffer

05:49.630 --> 05:51.360
if you don't hand in the money!

05:51.750 --> 05:53.390
I have many ways to make

05:54.040 --> 05:55.940
a living person tell the truth.

05:56.870 --> 05:58.120
Tie them up and take them away.

05:58.120 --> 06:00.050
A long interrogation awaits them.

06:00.720 --> 06:01.320
Hands off!

06:01.950 --> 06:02.510
Hu!

06:03.600 --> 06:03.950
Hu!

06:03.950 --> 06:05.750
Dig in the ground the house is on.

06:05.920 --> 06:07.720
Dig up Su's grave too.

06:07.750 --> 06:09.160
See if anything is hidden there.

06:09.160 --> 06:09.820
-Yes!
-Yes!

06:36.360 --> 06:37.220
Ms. Su,

06:37.920 --> 06:39.650
let me know if there's anything

06:39.750 --> 06:40.610
I can help with.

06:42.070 --> 06:43.760
Please meet my good friend,

06:44.040 --> 06:44.770
Mr. Gu, here.

06:44.800 --> 06:46.460
As a local, he is very familiar

06:46.480 --> 06:47.340
with Ningguta.

06:50.830 --> 06:51.750
I bought 300 horses

06:51.750 --> 06:53.150
from a local horse ranch.

06:53.159 --> 06:55.430
I need to transport them
to the Central Plains.

06:55.430 --> 06:57.690
Mr. Gu, do you have any good suggestions?

06:58.560 --> 06:59.510
Why would you

07:00.190 --> 07:01.720
buy horses from this place?

07:02.370 --> 07:03.430
Those in Sichuan

07:03.680 --> 07:05.480
and Yunnan have better stamina.

07:05.870 --> 07:07.200
Did you buy these horses

07:07.870 --> 07:08.600
for warfare?

07:12.570 --> 07:13.900
I wonder who you are.

07:14.270 --> 07:15.390
Are you sure

07:16.800 --> 07:17.730
you want to know?

07:20.040 --> 07:20.910
Well...

07:21.390 --> 07:22.480
You can hire a large ship

07:22.480 --> 07:23.940
and transport them by sea.

07:24.600 --> 07:26.800
The horses will be brought to the south.

07:26.870 --> 07:28.310
A sea journey will send them

07:28.310 --> 07:30.240
to the opposite direction, right?

07:30.600 --> 07:32.680
You're sending horses to the south...

07:32.680 --> 07:33.159
Are you...

07:33.159 --> 07:33.800
What?

07:36.750 --> 07:39.150
Mr. Gu, you can leave now
if you feel scared.

07:43.040 --> 07:43.950
You're a rebel.

07:44.430 --> 07:45.190
I'm an exile.

07:45.830 --> 07:47.360
I'm not afraid of anything.

07:49.680 --> 07:50.240
Mr. Gu,

07:51.190 --> 07:53.480
Don't you want to
help that mother and child?

07:53.480 --> 07:54.390
That kid and you

07:55.190 --> 07:57.120
could take the same route as Ms. Su.

07:57.430 --> 07:59.430
Helping Ms. Su is helping yourself.

08:03.720 --> 08:05.190
Ms. Su, where exactly are you

08:05.190 --> 08:06.070
sending these horses

08:06.070 --> 08:06.600
to?

08:07.120 --> 08:09.000
Your job is to get them out of the city.

08:09.000 --> 08:10.860
The rest is none of your business.

08:14.560 --> 08:15.210
Fine.

08:15.240 --> 08:15.830
Well,

08:16.360 --> 08:17.960
I'll come up with something.

08:18.950 --> 08:19.720
Hold on.

08:32.840 --> 08:34.240
Thank you so much, Mr. Gu.

08:44.150 --> 08:44.870
Ms. Su,

08:45.960 --> 08:48.560
aren't you worried
that he may leak the secret?

08:49.270 --> 08:50.440
He would've been shot many times

08:50.440 --> 08:52.370
if I hadn't opened the door for him.

08:53.240 --> 08:54.120
This man

08:55.360 --> 08:56.560
is very intelligent.

08:59.830 --> 09:03.060
[Commander Xu's Mansion]

09:01.390 --> 09:03.750
I extend my best regards to you,
Commander Xu.

09:03.750 --> 09:04.360
I'm humbly

09:05.030 --> 09:06.270
kowtowing to you.

09:09.240 --> 09:10.670
It's freezing cold.

09:11.910 --> 09:13.240
What are you doing here?

09:13.960 --> 09:15.240
At a friend's request,

09:15.630 --> 09:17.490
I need to transport some sea salt.

09:18.440 --> 09:19.500
Where are you from?

09:19.840 --> 09:20.770
Commander Xu,

09:21.030 --> 09:23.150
I'm from Pingyao, Shanxi Province.

09:24.150 --> 09:26.030
I've heard
that Shanxi is the wealthiest province

09:26.030 --> 09:27.140
in the country.

09:27.910 --> 09:29.090
People there

09:29.120 --> 09:30.120
are filthy rich.

09:31.200 --> 09:31.960
If this "gate gift"

09:31.960 --> 09:34.120
was presented by others,
I'd gladly accept it.

09:34.120 --> 09:34.960
But you...

09:36.840 --> 09:37.960
Gu Pingyuan has been away for a long time.

09:37.960 --> 09:39.020
Is he back yet?

09:39.120 --> 09:40.120
He just came back.

09:40.270 --> 09:41.800
Then why didn't you tell me?

09:42.440 --> 09:43.400
Get him here now!

09:43.440 --> 09:44.030
Yes!

09:46.670 --> 09:47.470
Commander Xu,

09:47.540 --> 09:48.840
I shall take my leave.

09:57.360 --> 09:57.860
Sir...

10:00.270 --> 10:01.930
Where were you running off to?

10:02.670 --> 10:04.130
I wouldn't dare to run off.

10:05.320 --> 10:07.080
I threw Su's wife

10:07.630 --> 10:08.740
and her kid

10:08.910 --> 10:10.170
to the dungeon.

10:11.080 --> 10:12.120
I even had Su's dead body

10:12.120 --> 10:13.270
dug up from the ground

10:13.270 --> 10:14.870
and searched several times.

10:15.270 --> 10:17.330
Where on earth did he hide the money?

10:18.120 --> 10:18.950
I want you

10:19.550 --> 10:21.370
to dispose of this matter.

10:21.840 --> 10:23.170
I'll talk to Su's widow.

10:23.510 --> 10:24.250
However,

10:24.320 --> 10:26.180
she has lost her husband for good.

10:26.270 --> 10:27.270
How much shall we take

10:27.270 --> 10:29.000
from the money to be retrieved?

10:34.120 --> 10:36.630
Before the New Year,
I need to make a trip to Jilin

10:36.630 --> 10:38.080
to pay tribute to the brass.

10:38.080 --> 10:39.670
I need a lot of money.

10:41.790 --> 10:43.390
Solve this problem in 3 days.

10:43.480 --> 10:44.810
If you can't, next year,

10:45.510 --> 10:46.440
I'll send you to the mountain

10:46.440 --> 10:47.570
to catch wild bears.

10:48.790 --> 10:49.270
Yes.

10:50.790 --> 10:52.960
About that Shanxi man
who just talked to me,

10:52.960 --> 10:55.020
go to his place and trick a few hundred

10:55.200 --> 10:57.100
more silver taels out of his pocket.

10:57.100 --> 10:58.560
Otherwise, I won't let him

10:58.630 --> 11:00.630
take a single grain of sea salt away.

11:01.200 --> 11:01.600
Got it.

11:48.840 --> 11:49.320
Father.

11:52.270 --> 11:53.200
Make me some tea.

12:00.000 --> 12:00.440
I'll get that.

12:00.440 --> 12:01.100
Patriarch.

12:09.600 --> 12:11.400
It's getting colder and colder.

12:12.390 --> 12:12.870
We've been stuck here

12:12.870 --> 12:14.000
for a couple of days.

12:15.600 --> 12:17.060
Seems like a waste of time.

12:20.360 --> 12:21.990
You think I'm not anxious?

12:23.440 --> 12:25.160
Commander Xu

12:26.390 --> 12:28.380
is very greedy

12:28.440 --> 12:29.250
for money.

12:31.080 --> 12:32.200
Mr. Gu told me

12:32.360 --> 12:34.290
200 to 300 taels of silver would do.

12:34.630 --> 12:36.440
To get Commander Xu's approval sooner,

12:36.440 --> 12:38.170
I added one more hundred taels.

12:38.320 --> 12:40.380
Unexpectedly, he declined my offer.

12:40.910 --> 12:41.910
What does he want then?

12:41.910 --> 12:42.370
Shall we

12:42.670 --> 12:44.130
give him an extra hundred?

12:47.720 --> 12:48.210
No.

12:49.120 --> 12:49.960
We can't keep offering him more

12:49.960 --> 12:51.550
like adding oil to a lamp nonstop.

12:51.550 --> 12:52.440
Raising the amount

12:52.440 --> 12:53.320
again and again

12:54.030 --> 12:55.960
will only make him force us to stay.

12:59.000 --> 12:59.510
I made

12:59.870 --> 13:01.400
a hasty move on this matter.

13:01.510 --> 13:02.570
We'll have to wait.

13:02.630 --> 13:03.890
When Mr. Gu comes here,

13:04.080 --> 13:05.410
I'll ask him for advice.

13:06.600 --> 13:07.080
Father,

13:07.960 --> 13:09.270
didn't we already meet

13:09.630 --> 13:10.320
Mr. Gu once,

13:10.320 --> 13:11.200
when we entered

13:11.270 --> 13:12.080
the city?

13:15.670 --> 13:17.120
How come I didn't know that?

13:17.120 --> 13:18.520
He looked imposing.

13:18.790 --> 13:19.870
Last time he was here,

13:19.870 --> 13:21.270
he taught me how to heat up a brick stove.

13:21.270 --> 13:23.150
His image just popped up in my head.

13:23.150 --> 13:23.790
Oh,

13:24.440 --> 13:26.510
you have such a great memory, don't you?

13:26.510 --> 13:28.750
But you should reflect on your behavior.

13:28.750 --> 13:29.910
you're a young lady.

13:30.670 --> 13:32.430
Talking to strangers eagerly

13:32.870 --> 13:34.470
is not exactly good manners.

13:37.790 --> 13:39.030
I'll go check on the horses.

13:39.030 --> 13:40.080
It's too cold now.

13:40.390 --> 13:41.850
They might need more food.

13:48.320 --> 13:49.670
I'm going to bed, Father.

13:49.670 --> 13:51.510
Refill my cup before you leave!

14:01.670 --> 14:02.600
I wouldn't dare

14:02.630 --> 14:04.390
to do so without your order.

14:04.790 --> 14:06.550
I'd hate to look ill-mannered,

14:06.670 --> 14:08.400
disrespectful, and annoying.

14:12.480 --> 14:13.740
My precious daughter,

14:13.750 --> 14:14.550
do you know

14:14.550 --> 14:15.610
what this place is?

14:16.750 --> 14:17.790
Ningguta.

14:18.030 --> 14:20.240
Who would stay here other than exiles?

14:20.630 --> 14:22.330
We must never drop our guard.

14:23.120 --> 14:23.600
Let's

14:23.750 --> 14:25.590
just finish our business

14:25.630 --> 14:26.890
go home for New Year's.

14:27.930 --> 14:29.200
Why so nosy?

14:31.960 --> 14:32.550
Father.

14:33.750 --> 14:34.750
Tell me...

14:35.840 --> 14:37.550
Is Mr. Gu

14:38.270 --> 14:39.120
a bandit

14:39.600 --> 14:42.200
who kills without mercy
and eats human organs?

14:43.720 --> 14:44.780
Like a gang leader?

14:45.910 --> 14:47.750
You've been listening to
too many stories.

14:47.750 --> 14:49.880
Why don't you ask around for an answer?

14:51.030 --> 14:52.240
I'm having trouble dealing

14:52.240 --> 14:53.440
with urgent matters.

14:54.030 --> 14:54.960
How do I have time

14:54.960 --> 14:57.160
to ask others about such trivial stuff?

14:57.200 --> 14:57.790
Go to bed.

15:10.080 --> 15:11.030
Mr. Gu.

15:16.840 --> 15:17.390
Hu,

15:17.510 --> 15:18.080
hurry.

15:23.080 --> 15:23.600
Mrs. Su,

15:24.080 --> 15:25.100
I've got Su's body

15:25.440 --> 15:26.120
back

15:26.360 --> 15:27.160
and buried it.

15:27.720 --> 15:28.450
Don't worry.

15:28.910 --> 15:29.970
When spring comes,

15:30.440 --> 15:32.020
I'll have his grave fixed,

15:32.360 --> 15:33.560
and hire a stonemason

15:33.870 --> 15:35.600
to carve a proper stele for him.

15:36.960 --> 15:38.560
Thank you for your kindness.

15:39.240 --> 15:40.080
Mr. Gu,

15:40.630 --> 15:42.850
Commander Xu promised me

15:43.480 --> 15:44.810
that if I told the truth,

15:45.390 --> 15:46.440
he would give my son

15:46.440 --> 15:48.000
a job as a soldier,

15:48.960 --> 15:50.870
and buy me a house in the city.

15:53.150 --> 15:54.210
Did you agree to it?

15:54.870 --> 15:56.350
If a tiger told you

15:57.870 --> 15:59.410
it'd only eat your arms

15:59.910 --> 16:01.440
and leave your legs intact,

16:02.390 --> 16:03.590
would you believe it?

16:07.440 --> 16:08.570
Commander Xu wishes

16:09.480 --> 16:11.120
he could eat us

16:11.150 --> 16:12.440
alive.

16:14.600 --> 16:16.200
You're insightful, Mrs. Su.

16:16.440 --> 16:17.640
He has set a deadline.

16:18.360 --> 16:19.690
How many days till that?

16:19.910 --> 16:20.440
Three.

16:21.630 --> 16:23.630
I'll get you out as soon as possible.

16:23.670 --> 16:24.930
You must hang in there.

16:26.920 --> 16:27.600
Mr. Gu,

16:28.720 --> 16:30.520
I'm begging you—just this once.

16:31.510 --> 16:33.620
Please take my child with you.

16:33.670 --> 16:35.480
-I'm begging you. Please.
-Mom!

16:35.720 --> 16:36.790
Please!

16:36.840 --> 16:37.660
Please!

16:37.750 --> 16:39.080
I'm not going anywhere.

16:39.120 --> 16:40.150
Quiet down.

16:40.320 --> 16:42.050
I just want to stay by your side!

16:42.600 --> 16:43.840
I just want to stay by your side!

16:43.840 --> 16:45.000
I'm begging you.

16:45.080 --> 16:47.320
I'll kowtow to you, Mr. Gu!

16:47.390 --> 16:48.120
I only...

16:48.670 --> 16:50.320
I only ask for this one thing—

16:50.390 --> 16:52.790
please take my child with you.

16:58.200 --> 16:58.800
Mr. Chang!

17:00.200 --> 17:00.900
Mr. Gu,

17:01.390 --> 17:02.720
thank heavens you're finally here.

17:02.720 --> 17:03.380
Come, come.

17:04.270 --> 17:05.130
Please come in!

17:06.000 --> 17:07.510
Were you exiled to Ningguta

17:07.510 --> 17:08.640
because you were a notorious bandit

17:08.640 --> 17:10.750
or because you were
a scholar who rebelled?

17:10.750 --> 17:11.920
Stop talking nonsense.

17:11.920 --> 17:13.579
Pour the tea and step outside.

17:23.470 --> 17:24.160
Mr. Gu.

17:25.510 --> 17:26.960
Mr. Chang, how much
did you offer Commander Xu

17:26.960 --> 17:28.440
as a "gate gift"
when you visited him last time?

17:28.440 --> 17:30.310
Since I was desperate to get home,

17:30.350 --> 17:31.680
I offered him 400 taels.

17:31.920 --> 17:33.510
But Commander Xu insisted

17:33.590 --> 17:35.070
Shanxi is the wealthiest province
under heaven,

17:35.070 --> 17:36.110
and that amount just wouldn't cut it.

17:36.110 --> 17:38.110
The more you give,
the worse it gets.

17:38.350 --> 17:40.110
It'll only make him think
you're drowning in silver.

17:40.110 --> 17:41.370
Just tell me straight.

17:41.590 --> 17:43.000
If you're willing to help,

17:43.000 --> 17:44.200
how much will it take?

17:44.750 --> 17:46.150
Sorry for the bluntness.

17:47.680 --> 17:48.540
How about this?

17:49.270 --> 17:49.880
In 3 days,

17:50.960 --> 17:51.490
I'll have

17:51.510 --> 17:53.000
the salt license
stamped with the city's defense seal

17:53.000 --> 17:54.000
delivered to you.

17:54.750 --> 17:55.680
As for the money,

17:55.920 --> 17:57.030
it's no use to me here

17:57.030 --> 17:58.160
in Ningguta anyway.

17:59.110 --> 18:00.390
But I do have one matter

18:00.440 --> 18:01.900
that I need your help with.

18:02.200 --> 18:04.130
I'll tell you about it in a few days.

18:04.680 --> 18:05.390
Mr. Gu,

18:06.200 --> 18:07.730
if you can help me

18:07.830 --> 18:09.290
through this rough patch,

18:09.440 --> 18:09.960
then

18:10.400 --> 18:11.550
whatever you ask of me in the future,

18:11.550 --> 18:13.410
I'll give it everything I've got.

18:16.350 --> 18:17.000
Mr. Gu.

18:20.200 --> 18:20.720
What is it?

18:20.720 --> 18:23.380
Does Mr. Chang still have instructions
to give?

18:23.590 --> 18:25.800
He has nothing more to say,

18:26.200 --> 18:27.050
but I'd like

18:27.160 --> 18:28.950
to ask you something—if that's alright?

18:28.950 --> 18:29.480
Go ahead.

18:30.480 --> 18:32.400
How long have you been exiled?

18:34.070 --> 18:35.360
This coming New Year

18:35.480 --> 18:37.080
will make it five full years.

18:37.200 --> 18:38.000
I've heard this place

18:38.000 --> 18:39.660
is full of outlaws and rebels,

18:39.790 --> 18:41.720
but you don't really seem like one.

18:45.200 --> 18:46.600
I am an outlaw and a rebel.

18:48.240 --> 18:50.040
I killed many people in the past.

18:50.790 --> 18:51.720
Wherever I went,

18:52.350 --> 18:53.680
nothing was left alive.

18:54.720 --> 18:56.050
I didn't just kill them,

18:56.680 --> 18:57.940
I tore out their sinews

18:58.750 --> 19:00.010
and drank their blood.

19:04.480 --> 19:05.730
You must be lying.

19:06.160 --> 19:08.350
You look like a scholar.

19:08.790 --> 19:09.720
If I were a thief or a rebel,

19:09.720 --> 19:10.550
it would be better.

19:10.550 --> 19:11.350
Just kill me

19:11.720 --> 19:12.480
so I don't have to

19:12.480 --> 19:15.140
be stuck here
in this useless, miserable state.

19:15.310 --> 19:17.110
A scholar is good for nothing.

19:17.270 --> 19:18.000
If possible,

19:18.030 --> 19:20.290
never come to this dreadful place again.

19:21.680 --> 19:23.110
You think I'm afraid?

19:23.310 --> 19:25.440
I went with my father to deliver medicinal
herbs to the western Mongolia.

19:25.440 --> 19:26.960
It was spring when we got there.

19:26.960 --> 19:28.350
Wolves were everywhere.

19:28.350 --> 19:29.550
We had to light torches

19:29.550 --> 19:30.550
and circle ourselves with fire to sleep,

19:30.550 --> 19:31.680
but I wasn't afraid.

19:34.030 --> 19:35.720
Sure, wolves were vicious,

19:36.030 --> 19:38.110
but still better than
most people by a long shot.

19:38.110 --> 19:39.910
The cruelest thing under the sky

19:40.590 --> 19:41.650
is the human heart.

19:41.830 --> 19:43.210
Young though you are,

19:43.510 --> 19:45.090
you talk like some old man.

19:45.480 --> 19:46.030
Do I?

19:47.750 --> 19:49.400
What crime did you commit
to end up here?

19:49.400 --> 19:51.350
You don't have to tell me
if you don't want to.

19:51.350 --> 19:52.550
It's fine to tell you.

19:54.000 --> 19:55.550
Back when I took the imperial exam...

19:55.550 --> 19:57.610
You mean the exam for the top scholar?

19:58.160 --> 19:58.590
Yes,

19:58.790 --> 20:00.310
the exam for the top scholar.

20:00.310 --> 20:01.590
Back when I took the imperial exam,

20:01.590 --> 20:04.160
someone outside the hall
suddenly called my name,

20:04.160 --> 20:06.030
saying my mother
was seriously ill at home.

20:06.030 --> 20:07.110
How could I possibly concentrate

20:07.110 --> 20:08.240
after hearing that?

20:08.440 --> 20:09.880
I turned in my paper in a rush,

20:09.880 --> 20:10.800
ready to leave,

20:11.000 --> 20:12.960
but there were strict rules
in the examination hall.

20:12.960 --> 20:14.720
I got into an argument with the officials.

20:14.720 --> 20:15.240
They

20:15.590 --> 20:17.000
accused me of disrupting the exam hall,

20:17.000 --> 20:17.750
arrested me,

20:18.200 --> 20:19.260
and exiled me here.

20:19.340 --> 20:19.640
So

20:20.090 --> 20:21.430
you were framed?

20:22.920 --> 20:24.650
I even asked around afterward.

20:24.680 --> 20:26.810
My mother was perfectly fine in Anhui.

20:27.000 --> 20:28.110
It's obvious that someone

20:28.110 --> 20:30.240
set me up during the examination hall.

20:30.680 --> 20:31.920
These past five years,

20:31.920 --> 20:33.310
I've thought about it day and night,

20:33.310 --> 20:35.240
but I still haven't figured it out.

20:37.110 --> 20:38.140
You're a good man.

20:38.590 --> 20:39.790
May heaven bless you.

20:39.790 --> 20:40.920
You'll get to the bottom of this.

20:40.920 --> 20:41.920
You won't stay wrongly accused

20:41.920 --> 20:43.310
your whole life without answers.

20:43.310 --> 20:43.960
Girl,

20:44.110 --> 20:45.440
where did you run off to?

20:45.750 --> 20:46.410
I'm coming!

20:48.310 --> 20:49.440
Let me ask you again:

20:50.270 --> 20:51.730
you must've suffered a lot

20:52.000 --> 20:53.400
these five years, right?

20:55.270 --> 20:57.330
Compared to others, I've had it okay.

20:57.400 --> 20:58.270
That first year,

20:58.270 --> 21:00.160
I worked in the salt fields by the sea—

21:00.160 --> 21:01.370
almost went blind.

21:02.030 --> 21:03.680
Later, I met someone who knew medicine

21:03.680 --> 21:04.920
and helped nurse me back

21:04.920 --> 21:05.960
to health.

21:08.750 --> 21:10.010
Is there anything else

21:10.310 --> 21:11.270
you want to ask?

21:13.110 --> 21:13.590
I...

21:14.150 --> 21:15.810
I... I have no more questions.

21:15.830 --> 21:17.090
My father was right.

21:17.310 --> 21:18.710
I'm terrible with words.

21:18.720 --> 21:20.000
Whatever I say seems to hit a nerve.

21:20.000 --> 21:21.000
Please don't be angry.

21:21.000 --> 21:21.310
I...

21:23.030 --> 21:24.440
When will you be back
in the Central Plains?

21:24.440 --> 21:25.700
Come find us in Shanxi.

21:36.700 --> 21:41.160
[Military Horse Camp, Ningguta]

22:02.750 --> 22:03.880
These Russians

22:04.480 --> 22:06.280
really know how to make weapons.

22:07.030 --> 22:08.370
If we could bring them over
to the Great Qing

22:08.370 --> 22:10.170
to build guns and cannons for us,

22:10.640 --> 22:11.920
we'd make a fortune.

22:12.270 --> 22:14.400
The southern war is intense right now.

22:14.550 --> 22:16.350
It's hard enough to buy weapons,

22:16.520 --> 22:18.730
let alone manufacture them.

22:19.100 --> 22:19.950
After all,

22:20.030 --> 22:22.030
your Li family are still merchants.

22:25.220 --> 22:27.420
You're not afraid to follow the rebels?

22:28.310 --> 22:29.510
Of course I'm scared.

22:30.640 --> 22:32.240
Good thing my dad told me

22:32.240 --> 22:33.830
who you were before I came.

22:35.030 --> 22:36.960
Otherwise, I'd never have guessed

22:37.000 --> 22:38.310
someone as stunning as you

22:38.310 --> 22:40.040
would be part of the rebellion.

22:40.160 --> 22:42.490
There's another thing I'm puzzled about.

22:42.510 --> 22:43.640
My father's the type

22:44.000 --> 22:45.550
who'd panic

22:45.590 --> 22:46.990
if a leaf fell on his head.

22:47.480 --> 22:50.240
How on earth did he end up
knowing someone like Ms. Su?

22:50.240 --> 22:51.380
That's because

22:51.480 --> 22:52.350
your family's business network

22:52.350 --> 22:53.510
spans the entire Yangtze River,
from north to south,

22:53.510 --> 22:55.240
all thanks to me protecting it.

22:55.550 --> 22:56.270
Maybe your family does business

22:56.270 --> 22:57.800
south of the Yangtze River,

22:58.160 --> 22:59.560
but you think he's timid?

23:00.920 --> 23:02.220
When it comes to money,

23:02.310 --> 23:05.570
even the most cautious merchants
grow bolder than the sky.

23:06.480 --> 23:06.960
I

23:08.000 --> 23:09.860
Your friend should be here by now.

23:10.310 --> 23:11.440
Is Ms. Su here?

23:12.270 --> 23:13.030
Gu!

23:13.240 --> 23:13.920
Come in!

23:17.400 --> 23:18.330
Come in, come in.

23:24.110 --> 23:24.770
Have a seat.

23:33.720 --> 23:34.720
Do you have a plan?

23:37.110 --> 23:38.400
I do have a plan.

23:39.240 --> 23:39.940
However,

23:40.000 --> 23:41.930
we need to settle something first.

23:43.440 --> 23:44.030
Go ahead.

23:44.680 --> 23:46.610
I'll naturally agree to what I can.

23:50.920 --> 23:53.320
Getting out of Ningguta might be possible,

23:53.920 --> 23:55.450
but after leaving the city,

23:55.640 --> 23:57.550
what's your plan for getting away?

23:57.550 --> 23:58.810
I naturally have a way.

23:59.440 --> 24:00.240
That won't do.

24:02.870 --> 24:03.440
You need to point me

24:03.440 --> 24:04.550
to a reliable path.

24:05.310 --> 24:07.070
With these 300 warhorses of yours,

24:07.070 --> 24:08.150
it won't be easy

24:08.640 --> 24:10.400
to get past any checkpoint
once we leave the city.

24:10.400 --> 24:10.790
Besides,

24:10.790 --> 24:12.240
I'm still carrying a child with me.

24:12.240 --> 24:13.110
I can't just recklessly

24:13.110 --> 24:14.400
risk my life, can I?

24:18.830 --> 24:19.400
Gu,

24:19.590 --> 24:21.120
I think you're just afraid.

24:22.680 --> 24:24.680
I risked my life to come to Ningguta.

24:25.310 --> 24:26.640
I'm not afraid of death.

24:27.160 --> 24:28.000
It's just that

24:28.080 --> 24:30.680
I still have an elderly mother
and brothers at home.

24:30.680 --> 24:32.340
I can't drag them into trouble

24:32.920 --> 24:34.920
because of my association with you.

24:36.110 --> 24:37.710
You need to make me trust you.

24:42.750 --> 24:43.550
Give it to him.

24:48.240 --> 24:49.240
The defender of Liaoyang Fortress

24:49.240 --> 24:50.070
are ours.

24:50.720 --> 24:51.550
He has already prepared

24:51.550 --> 24:53.080
the official passes for us.

24:53.270 --> 24:55.550
We will pass through
Shanhai Pass, enter Zhili,

24:55.550 --> 24:56.750
proceed to Shandong,

24:57.160 --> 24:59.220
and then take a ship back to the south.

25:00.830 --> 25:01.310
Good.

25:02.070 --> 25:03.070
That's fine then.

25:06.270 --> 25:07.480
Mr. Gu, it would be much better for you

25:07.480 --> 25:08.740
to return south with me

25:08.950 --> 25:10.880
than to stay in the Central Plains.

25:11.550 --> 25:12.280
I won't be...

25:16.400 --> 25:17.160
Rebel?

25:18.200 --> 25:20.070
Is the word that scary?

25:21.240 --> 25:23.170
You'd rather stay here as a servant

25:23.590 --> 25:24.880
than serve me.

25:25.790 --> 25:27.270
Everyone has their own ambitions.

25:27.270 --> 25:27.980
Gu,

25:28.480 --> 25:30.390
you're now an exile.

25:30.680 --> 25:32.080
Who would dare take you in

25:32.200 --> 25:33.600
or offer you protection?

25:34.000 --> 25:36.240
You want to study for the imperial exams,
but you're ineligible.

25:36.240 --> 25:37.270
You want to go into business,

25:37.270 --> 25:39.570
but you don't even
have a registered household.

25:39.570 --> 25:41.830
Do you dare go home in your current state?

25:42.400 --> 25:43.960
Though heaven and earth are vast,

25:43.960 --> 25:45.820
there's no place for you to stand.

25:46.310 --> 25:48.260
If you're being honest with yourself,

25:48.260 --> 25:50.200
is it worth

25:50.480 --> 25:52.140
living in the Central Plains

25:53.070 --> 25:55.130
like a fugitive, constantly in fear?

25:55.590 --> 25:56.350
To be honest,

25:57.350 --> 25:59.210
my elderly mother is weak and ill.

25:59.720 --> 26:01.200
If I stay here any longer,

26:02.240 --> 26:03.070
I may never get the chance

26:03.070 --> 26:04.400
to see her one last time.

26:05.350 --> 26:07.750
I was humiliated at
the examination hall back then.

26:07.750 --> 26:08.480
My grievance

26:08.790 --> 26:10.320
must also be investigated.

26:10.830 --> 26:12.960
How can a real man grow old here in vain?

26:16.720 --> 26:18.450
If Ms. Su can help this time,

26:19.240 --> 26:20.110
I, Gu Pingyuan,

26:20.400 --> 26:23.200
will certainly repay you
with eternal gratitude.

26:26.640 --> 26:27.310
Alright.

26:28.720 --> 26:30.480
I'll hold you to that, Mr. Gu.

26:33.830 --> 26:35.110
A small gift for our meeting.

26:35.110 --> 26:36.570
Keep it for self-defense.

26:50.440 --> 26:51.070
Li Qin,

26:51.640 --> 26:53.440
you're not married yet, are you?

26:53.510 --> 26:54.440
Of course not.

26:54.830 --> 26:55.830
That's good then.

26:56.270 --> 26:57.670
The girls in our Ningguta

26:58.160 --> 26:59.360
are quite something.

26:59.640 --> 27:00.830
It would be a pity

27:01.160 --> 27:02.310
if you didn't find a wife.

27:02.310 --> 27:04.040
What nonsense are you talking?

27:04.040 --> 27:05.300
What a brilliant plan!

27:06.720 --> 27:07.450
-Come on.
-Great!

27:07.450 --> 27:08.430
Follow me into the city,

27:08.430 --> 27:09.790
and I'll pick the best one for you.

27:09.790 --> 27:10.240
Wait,

27:10.270 --> 27:11.810
why does it have to be me?

27:11.920 --> 27:13.110
Who else could carry

27:13.110 --> 27:14.200
such a grand spectacle but you,

27:14.200 --> 27:16.150
Young Master Li Qin
of the Five Provinces Association?

27:16.150 --> 27:16.760
Wait,

27:17.640 --> 27:19.170
does it really have to be me?

27:23.830 --> 27:24.510
Ladies!

27:25.030 --> 27:26.200
Ladies, come quickly!

27:26.200 --> 27:28.400
Consort Yang, Xishi, Little Zhaojun!

27:31.920 --> 27:32.720
Come quickly!

27:35.270 --> 27:36.270
They're coming!

27:37.640 --> 27:38.590
Coming, coming!

27:39.310 --> 27:40.310
He's so handsome!

27:42.160 --> 27:43.160
He's so handsome!

27:43.590 --> 27:44.740
He's so handsome!

27:44.790 --> 27:45.880
Ladies, please calm down.

27:45.880 --> 27:46.610
Listen to me,

27:46.870 --> 27:47.310
this is

27:47.510 --> 27:49.330
Young Master Li Qin,

27:49.400 --> 27:52.660
the heir of the Five Provinces Association
in the capital.

27:53.350 --> 27:55.400
Last night, he had a dream

27:55.960 --> 27:57.720
and insisted on choosing one of you

27:57.720 --> 27:59.110
to be his wife,

27:59.200 --> 28:00.310
and even wants to
take her back to the capital

28:00.310 --> 28:01.710
to be the young mistress.

28:02.240 --> 28:03.400
Pick me!

28:05.070 --> 28:05.560
Calm down!

28:05.560 --> 28:06.620
Calm down! Well...

28:08.350 --> 28:09.270
And me!

28:09.270 --> 28:10.240
Pick me!

28:10.310 --> 28:11.720
I, I, I... pick...

28:11.830 --> 28:13.830
Pick me!

28:14.310 --> 28:15.140
Pick me!

28:15.480 --> 28:16.880
Choose me! He's chosen!

28:17.680 --> 28:19.400
Great, this early in the morning,

28:19.400 --> 28:20.960
a good man is rushing in.

28:22.400 --> 28:23.680
You really have no taste!

28:23.680 --> 28:25.150
Why didn't you choose me?

28:25.200 --> 28:26.000
Just go away.

28:26.110 --> 28:27.460
Go.

28:27.830 --> 28:28.550
Go!

28:28.640 --> 28:31.000
Miss, could you please get down first?

28:32.000 --> 28:32.930
I won't get down.

28:37.270 --> 28:37.960
Zhaojun,

28:38.720 --> 28:40.130
why don't you go back

28:40.310 --> 28:41.430
and freshen up?

28:41.480 --> 28:43.880
I'll be taking you
to the capital tomorrow.

28:44.440 --> 28:45.640
I'm not getting down.

28:47.640 --> 28:48.170
I...

28:59.790 --> 29:00.920
That's more like it.

29:01.400 --> 29:02.260
Let me tell you,

29:02.310 --> 29:03.510
you're really lucky.

29:03.680 --> 29:04.610
When I leave,

29:04.640 --> 29:05.510
half the men in Ningguta

29:05.510 --> 29:06.510
will be

29:06.590 --> 29:07.680
crying their eyes out.

29:07.680 --> 29:08.410
I suppose so.

29:09.510 --> 29:10.520
Mr. Li,

29:10.680 --> 29:12.440
I'll go prepare the bridal chamber.

29:12.440 --> 29:13.040
Excuse me.

29:13.310 --> 29:14.110
See you later.

29:15.310 --> 29:17.030
I'll return the contract
of indenture to her.

29:17.030 --> 29:17.560
Goodbye.

29:27.640 --> 29:28.500
Thank you both.

29:29.920 --> 29:30.720
Please get up.

29:53.480 --> 29:54.540
I might as well die.

29:55.700 --> 29:57.360
Ah, a paradise of tenderness.

29:57.640 --> 29:59.640
It seems you're reluctant to leave.

30:01.080 --> 30:01.640
Get lost!

30:18.080 --> 30:21.490
[Happiness]

30:20.240 --> 30:20.830
Congratulations!

30:20.830 --> 30:22.310
Here comes the bride!

30:22.960 --> 30:24.600
Here comes the bride!

30:25.350 --> 30:26.350
The bride is here!

30:27.070 --> 30:28.600
Congratulations!

30:32.550 --> 30:34.480
Let the newlyweds
enter the bridal chamber.

30:34.480 --> 30:35.920
Enter the chamber.

30:36.030 --> 30:37.880
Good!

30:38.790 --> 30:39.720
-Come.
-Please.

30:43.270 --> 30:44.330
Congratulations!

30:44.350 --> 30:45.750
Congratulations!

31:01.640 --> 31:03.040
Let me tell you some news.

31:03.750 --> 31:05.960
The young master of the
Five Provinces Association in the capital

31:05.960 --> 31:07.760
is getting married in a brothel.

31:08.030 --> 31:09.350
And half the city's people

31:09.350 --> 31:10.480
are going to join in the fun.

31:10.480 --> 31:11.340
Anyone who goes

31:11.400 --> 31:12.730
gets silver as a reward.

31:12.880 --> 31:14.000
It's a banquet

31:14.030 --> 31:15.160
with four plates and eight bowls,

31:15.160 --> 31:16.360
all-you-can-drink.

31:16.550 --> 31:17.480
I just came back.

31:19.920 --> 31:21.010
I'm going in now

31:21.550 --> 31:22.830
to have a drink with him.

31:22.830 --> 31:23.660
You know,

31:23.960 --> 31:25.960
he lies down when he drinks too much.

31:26.240 --> 31:27.240
So, do you need...

31:36.310 --> 31:36.920
Sir.

31:39.200 --> 31:40.400
I think you're tired of

31:40.400 --> 31:41.680
your own life.

31:42.830 --> 31:44.690
No need to wait until next spring.

31:45.000 --> 31:46.510
I'll throw you into
the mountains right now

31:46.510 --> 31:47.510
to feed the bears.

31:49.000 --> 31:50.260
Please calm down, Sir.

31:50.440 --> 31:51.680
Why are you so angry?

31:53.060 --> 31:54.350
I assigned you two tasks.

31:54.350 --> 31:55.750
Have you completed them?

31:56.200 --> 31:57.090
Speak.

31:58.350 --> 31:59.190
Sir,

32:00.110 --> 32:01.520
I've completed

32:01.720 --> 32:02.920
the two tasks you assigned me.

32:02.920 --> 32:03.920
Where's the money?

32:03.920 --> 32:05.920
I've spoken with the mother and son.

32:06.200 --> 32:06.830
They said

32:07.000 --> 32:08.730
They said you're very merciful

32:08.880 --> 32:10.000
for asking only 50,000 taels.

32:10.000 --> 32:11.070
They even said that

32:11.110 --> 32:12.160
if they could be
returned to the Central Plains,

32:12.160 --> 32:13.390
they'd be willing to

32:13.510 --> 32:15.280
dutifully hand over 10,000.

32:19.310 --> 32:20.170
Did you promise

32:22.000 --> 32:23.460
to actually set them free?

32:23.960 --> 32:25.070
How many years remain

32:25.070 --> 32:26.400
on your sentence?

32:26.920 --> 32:27.780
Ten more years.

32:28.350 --> 32:29.760
Get me the silver notes,

32:31.790 --> 32:33.250
and I'll reduce it by five.

32:37.240 --> 32:37.880
Really?

32:39.310 --> 32:41.480
You'll send me back to the Central Plains,

32:41.480 --> 32:43.140
just like that mother and son?

32:50.070 --> 32:51.270
You'll return alive.

32:54.640 --> 32:55.440
I understand.

32:56.640 --> 32:57.160
Sir,

32:58.510 --> 32:59.910
please enjoy your drink.

33:00.000 --> 33:01.930
Before you finish this pot of wine,

33:02.270 --> 33:04.070
I'll bring you the silver notes.

33:21.880 --> 33:22.750
He trusts you.

33:23.990 --> 33:26.050
You must accept the child's respect.

33:29.790 --> 33:31.580
Every last one of us in Ningguta

33:32.030 --> 33:33.270
is greedy.

33:34.160 --> 33:35.090
We covet wealth,

33:35.240 --> 33:36.960
but more than that, we covet life itself.

33:36.960 --> 33:39.270
Every one of us
dreams of escaping this place.

33:39.270 --> 33:40.830
It's pathetic, and laughable.

33:40.830 --> 33:41.400
Gu,

33:42.200 --> 33:43.060
what about you?

33:44.000 --> 33:45.260
How did you end up here?

33:45.790 --> 33:47.160
Do you want to go back?

34:00.410 --> 34:04.410
[Happiness]

34:29.320 --> 34:31.250
Move again and I'll shoot you dead.

34:51.840 --> 34:53.440
I'm determined to save them.

34:53.920 --> 34:54.620
Xu,

34:55.630 --> 34:56.510
I've been patient for five years

34:56.510 --> 34:57.560
just for this day.

34:58.090 --> 35:00.420
I was framed in the imperial examination.

35:00.460 --> 35:01.990
I must find out the truth.

35:04.280 --> 35:05.080
What's wrong?

35:06.230 --> 35:07.360
Are you going to cry?

35:07.590 --> 35:09.190
Do you have something to say?

35:11.110 --> 35:11.640
Alright,

35:12.320 --> 35:13.050
don't shout.

35:14.280 --> 35:15.030
My life is worthless.

35:15.030 --> 35:16.690
At worst, we'll die together.

35:19.670 --> 35:20.190
Gu,

35:20.710 --> 35:21.960
let them go.

35:22.400 --> 35:23.920
I don't want the money anymore.

35:23.920 --> 35:25.710
You've made more than
enough over the years.

35:25.710 --> 35:27.850
You've driven so many people
to their deaths.

35:27.850 --> 35:28.630
If you're planning to settle scores

35:28.630 --> 35:30.090
over what happened today,

35:30.550 --> 35:31.680
come after me alone.

35:31.760 --> 35:32.620
Remember that?

35:37.110 --> 35:38.150
Gu,

35:38.880 --> 35:39.560
fine.

35:40.840 --> 35:42.630
In over 200 years in Ningguta,

35:43.510 --> 35:46.150
I've never seen a convict
dare to tie up an official.

35:46.150 --> 35:47.370
You won't escape.

35:48.590 --> 35:50.410
The next time we meet,

35:51.280 --> 35:52.990
I'll skin you alive!

35:58.000 --> 35:58.460
Come on.

35:59.000 --> 35:59.440
Heizi,

35:59.510 --> 36:00.840
tell the others to hurry up!

36:00.840 --> 36:01.400
Hurry up!

36:01.480 --> 36:02.010
Hurry up!

36:02.150 --> 36:02.680
Hurry up!

36:03.880 --> 36:04.410
Hurry up!

36:07.000 --> 36:08.480
Here, there's one more package.

36:08.480 --> 36:08.960
Father,

36:09.390 --> 36:12.580
[Ningyuan Salt Merchant]

36:09.630 --> 36:11.090
I've checked all the salt.

36:11.280 --> 36:11.760
Good.

36:12.840 --> 36:13.370
Alright.

36:14.000 --> 36:15.130
Get ready to go home.

36:15.360 --> 36:17.360
Tie it up; we're going home!

36:17.400 --> 36:18.480
Mount up.

36:23.110 --> 36:23.710
Hurry up!

36:23.220 --> 36:27.890
[A Tranquil Nation, A Contented People.]

36:38.880 --> 36:40.880
Congratulations on your marriage.

36:43.960 --> 36:45.160
Congratulations.

36:56.670 --> 36:58.670
You said you'd only take two people.

36:59.550 --> 37:01.360
I have to take both the mother and child.

37:01.360 --> 37:03.420
Whoever stays behind won't survive.

37:16.260 --> 37:20.130
[Ningguta]

37:38.840 --> 37:39.760
Someone!

37:39.940 --> 37:41.290
Someone!

37:45.710 --> 37:46.440
Someone!

37:52.010 --> 37:53.650
I'm going to kill him!

37:54.320 --> 37:56.280
I'll chop him into pieces!

37:56.840 --> 37:58.770
I'm going to kill him!

37:59.110 --> 38:01.800
Kill him!

38:04.000 --> 38:04.600
From here,

38:05.360 --> 38:06.360
if you keep going,

38:06.760 --> 38:08.090
you'll reach Liaoyang.

38:08.320 --> 38:09.520
This is where we part.

38:10.360 --> 38:11.820
You're not coming with us?

38:14.480 --> 38:15.670
Yesterday I gave that bastard Xu

38:15.670 --> 38:16.630
a real beating;

38:17.030 --> 38:18.690
he's not going to let it slide.

38:19.230 --> 38:20.430
If we stick together,

38:20.590 --> 38:22.550
none of us will make it out in the end.

38:22.550 --> 38:23.070
Gu.

38:24.480 --> 38:25.070
Mr. Li.

38:26.920 --> 38:28.050
If we manage to

38:28.150 --> 38:29.920
survive this by some stroke of luck,

38:29.920 --> 38:31.850
I'll see you in the Central Plains.

38:32.840 --> 38:33.320
Mr. Li.

38:33.880 --> 38:34.480
I'll leave

38:34.480 --> 38:36.280
Mrs. Su and her child in your care.

38:36.280 --> 38:37.010
Don't worry.

38:37.480 --> 38:39.010
I've arranged everything.

38:39.480 --> 38:40.320
I'll place the mother and child

38:40.320 --> 38:41.760
in a pharmacy in the capital.

38:41.760 --> 38:42.590
I'll buy them identities

38:42.590 --> 38:44.520
and let the child be an apprentice.

38:44.960 --> 38:46.360
The Li family has tens of
thousands of workers

38:46.360 --> 38:47.630
across the north and south.

38:47.630 --> 38:49.760
What's two more people to worry about?

38:50.270 --> 38:50.790
Gu,

38:51.920 --> 38:52.720
I promise you.

38:58.480 --> 38:59.010
Don't go.

39:01.110 --> 39:02.510
Say something, will you?

39:02.840 --> 39:04.370
If Commander Xu catches up,

39:04.500 --> 39:05.630
you can protect him.

39:06.440 --> 39:08.900
If he goes off on his own now,
he'll be killed.

39:09.000 --> 39:10.730
A debt repaid is a debt cleared.

39:10.880 --> 39:12.440
I'm taking these two with me—

39:12.440 --> 39:13.770
that settles what I owe.

39:14.590 --> 39:15.920
If you want to protect him,

39:15.920 --> 39:17.580
then come with me to the South.

39:18.400 --> 39:19.330
I'll be on my way.

39:22.030 --> 39:22.880
Ms. Su.

39:23.110 --> 39:24.310
Mr. Gu, wait a moment.

39:31.440 --> 39:32.880
When I first arrived in Ningguta,

39:32.880 --> 39:34.410
I couldn't help but wonder—

39:34.590 --> 39:35.920
how could so many exiled prisoners

39:35.920 --> 39:36.920
be living out in the open

39:36.920 --> 39:38.650
with no one watching over them?

39:39.270 --> 39:40.670
Later, I figured it out.

39:41.590 --> 39:42.710
For hundreds of miles around,

39:42.710 --> 39:44.280
there's not a sign of human habitation.

39:44.280 --> 39:45.680
There's no way to escape.

39:46.320 --> 39:48.380
Where else could you possibly run to?

39:49.000 --> 39:49.930
Let fate decide.

39:51.670 --> 39:53.400
But if you agree to come South with me,

39:53.400 --> 39:55.460
I have a way to keep you safe and sound.

39:56.840 --> 39:57.800
If I stay in Ningguta,

39:57.800 --> 39:59.530
I still have a chance to go back.

39:59.670 --> 40:01.190
But if I become a rebel,

40:01.630 --> 40:02.550
then there's really no chance

40:02.550 --> 40:03.280
at all.

40:04.760 --> 40:06.130
Ms. Su, I appreciate

40:06.840 --> 40:08.040
the kindness, truly.

40:09.050 --> 40:10.180
Our debt is settled.

40:24.590 --> 40:25.050
Report!

40:25.550 --> 40:26.080
General,

40:26.370 --> 40:27.630
General, someone saw that Gu.

40:27.630 --> 40:29.070
He ran towards Shuangjia Mountain.

40:29.070 --> 40:30.200
Still trying to run?

40:30.550 --> 40:32.110
He's just a scholar; he won't get far.

40:32.110 --> 40:33.550
Everyone pick up the pace!

40:33.550 --> 40:34.890
I'm going to grind that bastard

40:34.890 --> 40:36.070
into the dirt.

42:19.560 --> 42:20.990
Search carefully!

42:24.230 --> 42:26.290
How far can he run with an arrow in him?

42:26.590 --> 42:27.520
Keep searching!

42:28.280 --> 42:30.230
Everyone search carefully!

42:30.390 --> 42:31.250
There's blood.

42:31.590 --> 42:32.430
Nobody move!
